        "original_id": "4bb9811b-f472-5c2d-8515-cb922cbd0a27",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Jason, Sean Astin, Tim Curry, Christopher Lee\n- Works: Terry Pratchett's The Colour of Magic, Only Fools and Horses, A Touch of Frost\n- Companies: Sky1, The Mob\n- Roles: Death, Derek \"Del Boy\" Trotter, Detective Inspector Jack Frost\n\nFacts:\n- David Jason was born as Sir David John White on 2 February 1940 and is better known by his stage name David Jason.\n- David Jason is an English actor and comedian.\n- David Jason is best known for portraying Derek \"Del Boy\" Trotter in the BBC comedy series Only Fools and Horses.\n- David Jason is also known for portraying Detective Inspector Jack Frost in the ITV crime drama A Touch of Frost.\n- The fantasy film Terry Pratchett's The Colour of Magic was produced for Sky1 by The Mob, a small British studio.\n- Terry Pratchett's The Colour of Magic starred David Jason, Sean Astin, Tim Curry, and Christopher Lee as the voice of Death.",
